# Deliberately NOT ignored: data/, snapshots/ and reports/.
# The project follows a "collect data once" principle and old job postings
# disappear from the BIP site, so the accumulated dataset cannot be re-fetched.
# It is public-institution data (employer names and office addresses from job
# adverts), it weighs under a megabyte, and losing it would mean losing history.

# Raw conversation logs with the AI assistant. Kept on disk on purpose — they are
# the record of how this project was built — but never published: they contain
# unfiltered discussion, including remarks unrelated to the code.
session.jsonl
transcript.md

# Klucz API jooble — SEKRET, nie trafia do repozytorium.
jooble.key
